## Info about all SNe.
## RA,DEC will be used for MW extinction corrections
## EBV_MW, EBV_host: colour excess E(B-V) for Milky Way and host dust
## RV_MW, RV_host: total-to-selective extinction R_V for each (required; no default is assumed).
##   RV_host by Type (former notebook-1 table): Ic 4.3, Ic-BL 4.3, Ib 2.6, IIb 1.1, II 3.1, IIn 3.1, KN 3.1
## FullType: sub-type of the SN including peculiarities
## Type: sub-type of the SN. Must be one of [II, IIb, IIn, Ib, Ic, Ic-BL] (following Li et al. 2011 classification scheme)
## Rich_Type: sub-type of the SN. Must be one of [IIL, IIP, IIb, IIn, Ib, Ic, Ic-BL] (following Richardson et al. 2014 classification scheme)
